<section id="A1.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.4. </span>Computation Flow of LLaMA Decoder-only Transformer</h3>

<figure id="alg2" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg2.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 2</span> </span> Computation flow of a LLaMA decoder-only Transformer with embedding, lm_head, and with <math id="alg2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\,L\," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>L</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\,L\,</annotation></semantics></math> layers: each decoder layer performs <span id="alg2.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#B40F20;">[MatMul1–9]</span> interleaved with <span id="alg2.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps" style="--ltx-fg-color:#2171B5;">RMSNorm</span>, <span id="alg2.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps" style="--ltx-fg-color:#238B45;">RoPE</span> , and nonlinear activations (<span id="alg2.12" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps" style="--ltx-fg-color:#2171B5;">Softmax</span>, <span id="alg2.13" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps" style="--ltx-fg-color:#2171B5;">SiLU</span>).</figcaption>
<div id="alg2.14" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
